(1593466, 215121, 38818, '<td valign="top">This is a really good try at this kind of photo. It is pretty tough. 2 things.<br/>1. The girl in pink should be more centered on the big girls hand, instead of on the wrist.<br/>2. Try using a smaller aperature so you get a bigger DOF so that both subjects are in focus, the girl in pink is pretty out of focus.<br/>Greay try and keep trying your best!!!</td>', 'This is a really good try at this kind of photo. It is pretty tough. 2 things.1. The girl in pink should be more centered on the big girls hand, instead of on the wrist.2. Try using a smaller aperature so you get a bigger DOF so that both subjects are in focus, the girl in pink is pretty out of focus.Greay try and keep trying your best!!!', '2005-08-08 01:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
