(1593919, 212118, 35274, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...<br/>VERY cool and hauntingly dark image. It just seems more in the area of digital art, which I should state, is not legal in dpc challenges. (I am mostly refering to the compostited background, which would violate the addition/removal of major elements rule, and the text. Considering there is no text allowed, and especially not any copright statements that would reveal who the photog. is) So, what I''m trying to get at is, yes, it''s a very beautiful image, but it stands a high risk of being DQ''d unless you managed to do all of this within the rules and I''ve been blabbing on for nothing, lol :-) Now THAT would really be an illusion!!</td>', 'Hmmm...VERY cool and hauntingly dark image. It just seems more in the area of digital art, which I should state, is not legal in dpc challenges. (I am mostly refering to the compostited background, which would violate the addition/removal of major elements rule, and the text. Considering there is no text allowed, and especially not any copright statements that would reveal who the photog. is) So, what I''m trying to get at is, yes, it''s a very beautiful image, but it stands a high risk of being DQ''d unless you managed to do all of this within the rules and I''ve been blabbing on for nothing, lol :-) Now THAT would really be an illusion!!', '2005-08-08 03:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
