(1594447, 214299, 3669, '<td valign="top">Absolutely great illusion using the black bacground.  Lighting is superb.  I really like the expressions on the kid''s faces.  Big brothers can be such a bother!  :-)  10</td>', 'Absolutely great illusion using the black bacground.  Lighting is superb.  I really like the expressions on the kid''s faces.  Big brothers can be such a bother!  :-)  10', '2005-08-08 09:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
