(1594466, 214860, 3669, '<td valign="top">Just a tad weak in the illusion department, IMO.  Technically, not a bad picture.  I like the lighting.  The crop looks a tad crooked...could be rotated to the right just a couple of degrees.  Also, with this being advanced editing, the nail holes at the right could have been cloned out.</td>', 'Just a tad weak in the illusion department, IMO.  Technically, not a bad picture.  I like the lighting.  The crop looks a tad crooked...could be rotated to the right just a couple of degrees.  Also, with this being advanced editing, the nail holes at the right could have been cloned out.', '2005-08-08 10:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1594475, 214132, 3669, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture.  Although kind of weak as being an illusion, the backlighting of the sunset is beautiful and the kids look like they are having fun.  Technically, very well done. There appears to be another person in the background (at the left)  that could have been easily cloned out.  8</td>', 'I really like this picture.  Although kind of weak as being an illusion, the backlighting of the sunset is beautiful and the kids look like they are having fun.  Technically, very well done. There appears to be another person in the background (at the left)  that could have been easily cloned out.  8', '2005-08-08 10:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1594479, 214389, 3669, '<td valign="top">A very good attempt at capturing a roadrunner in action.  However, she really needs to be in better focus.</td>', 'A very good attempt at capturing a roadrunner in action.  However, she really needs to be in better focus.', '2005-08-08 10:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1594481, 215207, 32792, '<td valign="top">The most erotic, non-erotic picture I''ve ever seen!<br/>It''s a totally different picture from the thumbnail, but then I get so see the thumbnail image in my head. This is awesome! Love the tones on this shot!!!!<br/>You did an amazing job! 10 from me</td>', 'The most erotic, non-erotic picture I''ve ever seen!It''s a totally different picture from the thumbnail, but then I get so see the thumbnail image in my head. This is awesome! Love the tones on this shot!!!!You did an amazing job! 10 from me', '2005-08-08 10:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1594482, 214478, 30049, '<td valign="top">It came out pretty decent Chris (yes - I remembered the forum post).  Wonder how it would have worked to position yourself to catch a rainbow in the spray?  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It came out pretty decent Chris (yes - I remembered the forum post).  Wonder how it would have worked to position yourself to catch a rainbow in the spray?  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-08-08 10:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1594485, 215074, 3669, '<td valign="top">Your illusion is nicely built.  Good job on that.  However, the worn out legos are not visually appealing.  A basic box of Legos is not all that expensive.  Perhaps using only one color would have been better too.</td>', 'Your illusion is nicely built.  Good job on that.  However, the worn out legos are not visually appealing.  A basic box of Legos is not all that expensive.  Perhaps using only one color would have been better too.', '2005-08-08 10:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1594486, 215027, 8624, '<td valign="top">gtreat idea and well executed. I think the background, however, is distracting. It would have worked better if it was darker.</td>', 'gtreat idea and well executed. I think the background, however, is distracting. It would have worked better if it was darker.', '2005-08-08 10:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1594487, 212821, 30049, '<td valign="top">I almost did the same one!  ;^)  Hard to keep the lines in order...  I think this would have worked a bit better if you had included more grid so they weren''t so large when viewed in the voting window.  This (grey dots) works better in the thumbnail view IMO.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I almost did the same one!  ;^)  Hard to keep the lines in order...  I think this would have worked a bit better if you had included more grid so they weren''t so large when viewed in the voting window.  This (grey dots) works better in the thumbnail view IMO.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-08-08 10:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1594488, 214871, 31230, '<td valign="top">Very cool, but the skin tones are a little pink.</td>', 'Very cool, but the skin tones are a little pink.', '2005-08-08 10:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1594489, 215122, 3669, '<td valign="top">I just love Pooh.  He kind of clashes with the blue flowered background, though.  Nice mirrored illusion, however, it might have been good to clean the mirror before your shoot.</td>', 'I just love Pooh.  He kind of clashes with the blue flowered background, though.  Nice mirrored illusion, however, it might have been good to clean the mirror before your shoot.', '2005-08-08 10:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1594491, 215121, 31230, '<td valign="top">Very cool concept, I just wish both the girl and the fairy were sharp and the forest was a little blurry.  It looks like you focused on the background not the girl.</td>', 'Very cool concept, I just wish both the girl and the fairy were sharp and the forest was a little blurry.  It looks like you focused on the background not the girl.', '2005-08-08 10:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1594495, 214284, 31230, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like your lighting here.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like your lighting here.', '2005-08-08 10:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1594500, 215171, 31230, '<td valign="top">Yuck.  That being said, I don''t think the desated tones work here.  I get the illusion and myabe you were trying to be less gross by doing this, but honestly the full color would have made more of an impact.  Not my cup of tea but not a bad shot.</td>', 'Yuck.  That being said, I don''t think the desated tones work here.  I get the illusion and myabe you were trying to be less gross by doing this, but honestly the full color would have made more of an impact.  Not my cup of tea but not a bad shot.', '2005-08-08 10:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
