(1595043, 215074, 12583, '<td valign="top">I think the focus could be a bit more crisp here, and if the subjects were a little less dirty... there isn''t much appeal here, and I''m hard put to see the impossible... perhaps I''m just jaded though, having seen just about every trick legos (and duplos) can accomplish from working in daycare. I also think the colors take a bit away, though I know that''s just a personal thing... Perhaps in black and white?</td>', 'I think the focus could be a bit more crisp here, and if the subjects were a little less dirty... there isn''t much appeal here, and I''m hard put to see the impossible... perhaps I''m just jaded though, having seen just about every trick legos (and duplos) can accomplish from working in daycare. I also think the colors take a bit away, though I know that''s just a personal thing... Perhaps in black and white?', '2005-08-08 13:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
