(1595190, 211944, 35804, '<td valign="top">AWESOME abstract! Great coloring and movement...a cool monster indeed! I just love those reds and oranges...into my favs this goes...</td>', 'AWESOME abstract! Great coloring and movement...a cool monster indeed! I just love those reds and oranges...into my favs this goes...', '2005-08-08 14:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1595191, 215091, 36429, '<td valign="top">First Impression: A bit cold and lots of coloured noise (not to be confused with arty farty grain)hehe.<br/>Was I fooleded? YES! The first one that makes me scratch my head in my randomised list. Congratulations!</td>', 'First Impression: A bit cold and lots of coloured noise (not to be confused with arty farty grain)hehe.Was I fooleded? YES! The first one that makes me scratch my head in my randomised list. Congratulations!', '2005-08-08 14:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
