(1595195, 213690, 3669, '<td valign="top">I have been getting real tired of chess piece pictures, but I like this one and the illusion.  The lighting and muted colors are great.  The only thing...would it have been possible to have the same effect, but get the checkered board lines even with the top of the picture?  The angle is distracting to me.  9</td>', 'I have been getting real tired of chess piece pictures, but I like this one and the illusion.  The lighting and muted colors are great.  The only thing...would it have been possible to have the same effect, but get the checkered board lines even with the top of the picture?  The angle is distracting to me.  9', '2005-08-08 14:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1595198, 215211, 26255, '<td valign="top">the model is blurry.  I might like this more if the photographer were not visible and it was just an image of the camera and possibly the hand.</td>', 'the model is blurry.  I might like this more if the photographer were not visible and it was just an image of the camera and possibly the hand.', '2005-08-08 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1595199, 215036, 26255, '<td valign="top">I really like the image... the orange background is too much IMO.</td>', 'I really like the image... the orange background is too much IMO.', '2005-08-08 14:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
