(1595403, 214786, 11432, '<td valign="top">Wow, now that is cool! Great illusion, a natural one! Great lighting, great color, great texture!</td>', 'Wow, now that is cool! Great illusion, a natural one! Great lighting, great color, great texture!', '2005-08-08 16:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1595404, 214985, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good color, great detail good effect.</td>', 'Good color, great detail good effect.', '2005-08-08 16:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1595406, 212789, 30896, '<td valign="top">it s hard to vote - if it''s real, it''s magnificent, while painted and printed smoke would be too close to "literal representration". However, that is SC''s job and I have to resort to overall artistic impression - which is fine</td>', 'it s hard to vote - if it''s real, it''s magnificent, while painted and printed smoke would be too close to "literal representration". However, that is SC''s job and I have to resort to overall artistic impression - which is fine', '2005-08-08 16:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1595408, 213928, 11432, '<td valign="top">Good color, good detail, not sure what the transmission fluid is there for though.</td>', 'Good color, good detail, not sure what the transmission fluid is there for though.', '2005-08-08 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1595411, 212524, 11432, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, looking for a focus point. Ok, good color.</td>', 'Hmmm, looking for a focus point. Ok, good color.', '2005-08-08 16:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1595413, 214808, 36429, '<td valign="top">First Impression: Dang that background hurts it. Light is a bit harsh too, But this is such a beautifull image except for that background. <br/>Was I fooled? Yes. I can work out the mechanics, but still very good illusion.<br/> <br/>Please try this shot again with more ''magic'' in the lighting if (you want) Also with the balancing act on the highest flower maybe.<br/>Nice one.</td>', 'First Impression: Dang that background hurts it. Light is a bit harsh too, But this is such a beautifull image except for that background. Was I fooled? Yes. I can work out the mechanics, but still very good illusion. Please try this shot again with more ''magic'' in the lighting if (you want) Also with the balancing act on the highest flower maybe.Nice one.', '2005-08-08 16:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1595415, 214813, 11432, '<td valign="top">That''s cool, I like the effect, lighting is good, color is good, great detail.</td>', 'That''s cool, I like the effect, lighting is good, color is good, great detail.', '2005-08-08 16:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
