(1595425, 215074, 36429, '<td valign="top">First Impression: Not sure on this one. Very good and everything, but something hurts it, not sure if is the red, or the center face composition, the very white background. Not sure..<br/>Was I fooled? If the Lego was not worn, it would have been more effective. But nice illusion :)</td>', 'First Impression: Not sure on this one. Very good and everything, but something hurts it, not sure if is the red, or the center face composition, the very white background. Not sure..Was I fooled? If the Lego was not worn, it would have been more effective. But nice illusion :)', '2005-08-08 16:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1595430, 215015, 11432, '<td valign="top">Seems a little soft, good effect though, B/W is good.</td>', 'Seems a little soft, good effect though, B/W is good.', '2005-08-08 16:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1595432, 214450, 36429, '<td valign="top">First Impression: Very good! I like the tone, balance, colours and composition, everything on quite a difficuilt shot. ND Filters?<br/>Was I fooled? No. Too extreme. Doesn''t matter. One thing though, It looks as if the sun is supported by the models'' wrist. But on the other hand, if the sun was more foreward, the delicate fingers would be lost. <br/>10 Whichever way. I hope this Ribbons!</td>', 'First Impression: Very good! I like the tone, balance, colours and composition, everything on quite a difficuilt shot. ND Filters?Was I fooled? No. Too extreme. Doesn''t matter. One thing though, It looks as if the sun is supported by the models'' wrist. But on the other hand, if the sun was more foreward, the delicate fingers would be lost. 10 Whichever way. I hope this Ribbons!', '2005-08-08 16:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
