(1596461, 213720, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice use of angle to create the illusion of size.  IMHO, the colors could be bumped up a bit, but the detail and scale is good.</td>', 'Nice use of angle to create the illusion of size.  IMHO, the colors could be bumped up a bit, but the detail and scale is good.', '2005-08-08 22:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
