(1596472, 214456, 17203, '<td valign="top">A cute idea, and the illusion is well executed, but the small subject is all but lost in the clutter. A tighter crop and less "stuff" would have helped immensely IMO.</td>', 'A cute idea, and the illusion is well executed, but the small subject is all but lost in the clutter. A tighter crop and less "stuff" would have helped immensely IMO.', '2005-08-08 22:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
