(1596474, 213489, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is an unusual shot.  The sky being blown out is a little distracting too, but there is a certain appeal to the steeple and framework that seemingly appears coming from it.</td>', 'This is an unusual shot.  The sky being blown out is a little distracting too, but there is a certain appeal to the steeple and framework that seemingly appears coming from it.', '2005-08-08 22:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
