(1596486, 215165, 12583, '<td valign="top">This is a neat illusion. I just wish I "got" the point; I don''t, but I still appreciate the photographic value, so definitely I''m basing my score on that, not my lack of understanding. Well done. I like the choice of colors for the jeans and arms.</td>', 'This is a neat illusion. I just wish I "got" the point; I don''t, but I still appreciate the photographic value, so definitely I''m basing my score on that, not my lack of understanding. Well done. I like the choice of colors for the jeans and arms.', '2005-08-08 23:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596488, 214786, 12583, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic! I saw crabs just like this in Hawaii two weeks ago, but my camera was too slow and too suck at macro to catch them properly. Yours is wonderful, and I really think this fits the challenge. Fantastic capture, great work!</td>', 'This is fantastic! I saw crabs just like this in Hawaii two weeks ago, but my camera was too slow and too suck at macro to catch them properly. Yours is wonderful, and I really think this fits the challenge. Fantastic capture, great work!', '2005-08-08 23:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596489, 215121, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cool shot - I wish I could make out more detail in the small figure though.  Love the greens.</td>', 'Cool shot - I wish I could make out more detail in the small figure though.  Love the greens.', '2005-08-08 23:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596491, 215072, 34659, '<td valign="top">Neat shot and a cute model.  She looks happy and playful.  Good color and choice of background.</td>', 'Neat shot and a cute model.  She looks happy and playful.  Good color and choice of background.', '2005-08-08 23:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596492, 214761, 12583, '<td valign="top">The yellowish tint of the light area is really unatrractive to me, but the glasses are nice. I don''t understand the illusion very well, but that''s just me. I find I''m having that problem a lot in this challenge. :) I like the clarity of the glass "stems"</td>', 'The yellowish tint of the light area is really unatrractive to me, but the glasses are nice. I don''t understand the illusion very well, but that''s just me. I find I''m having that problem a lot in this challenge. :) I like the clarity of the glass "stems"', '2005-08-08 23:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596493, 214876, 34659, '<td valign="top">I remember this trick very well!  LOL  Well done - looks real.</td>', 'I remember this trick very well!  LOL  Well done - looks real.', '2005-08-08 23:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596495, 214880, 12583, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, but I *hate* the dirty-looking tile background. This would have been much more effective with the scale on a clean white or black surface, so the attention would be on your subject. The scale and ipod lack some clarity as well, but the illusion is neat!</td>', 'I love the idea, but I *hate* the dirty-looking tile background. This would have been much more effective with the scale on a clean white or black surface, so the attention would be on your subject. The scale and ipod lack some clarity as well, but the illusion is neat!', '2005-08-08 23:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596496, 213155, 34659, '<td valign="top">Stunningly beautiful shot.  It does look like it''s floating.  Lovely detail and composition.</td>', 'Stunningly beautiful shot.  It does look like it''s floating.  Lovely detail and composition.', '2005-08-08 23:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596498, 213657, 12583, '<td valign="top">This is a great, interesting, and unique shot. I just wish the background was a little less clear, perhaps more of a blur, and the colors were more bold and bright. The carpet needs some reds! :)</td>', 'This is a great, interesting, and unique shot. I just wish the background was a little less clear, perhaps more of a blur, and the colors were more bold and bright. The carpet needs some reds! :)', '2005-08-08 23:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596499, 213312, 34659, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the illusion is here, but it''s a cool shot.</td>', 'Not sure what the illusion is here, but it''s a cool shot.', '2005-08-08 23:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596501, 214927, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflection and the brick pattern underneath really makes this shot.  Nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful reflection and the brick pattern underneath really makes this shot.  Nice job.', '2005-08-08 23:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596502, 215121, 12583, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely picture. I love the positioning and the background (beautiful!!), and I have always liked this particular photographic illusion.  The girl lacks a bit in focus, but overall, Well done!</td>', 'This is a lovely picture. I love the positioning and the background (beautiful!!), and I have always liked this particular photographic illusion.  The girl lacks a bit in focus, but overall, Well done!', '2005-08-08 23:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596504, 215116, 12583, '<td valign="top">This is a neat illusion, though I did find the presence of the hand to be a bit distracting. I''d like there to be less hand, more water. Perhaps just fingertips and then the water sprays.</td>', 'This is a neat illusion, though I did find the presence of the hand to be a bit distracting. I''d like there to be less hand, more water. Perhaps just fingertips and then the water sprays.', '2005-08-08 23:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596505, 213869, 34659, '<td valign="top">The title is confusing, but makes me think that this must be a stuffed animal?  It''s a well composed shot and an interesting angle, but I don''t see the illusion, unless it''s that the horn is coming out of the antelope''s nose.</td>', 'The title is confusing, but makes me think that this must be a stuffed animal?  It''s a well composed shot and an interesting angle, but I don''t see the illusion, unless it''s that the horn is coming out of the antelope''s nose.', '2005-08-08 23:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596506, 215091, 12583, '<td valign="top">Aha! Fantastic illusion, I love it. Well done :)</td>', 'Aha! Fantastic illusion, I love it. Well done :)', '2005-08-08 23:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596508, 215122, 28070, '<td valign="top">That is a cool idea.  I remember when I was a kid trying to look and see how far back I could see, or how many reflections I could count in a mirror setup like this.  The mirror looks a little dirty, The environment/table cloth/bed comforter or something could have been different.  I don''t know what.  Maybe outside some where with a clean mirror. Something.</td>', 'That is a cool idea.  I remember when I was a kid trying to look and see how far back I could see, or how many reflections I could count in a mirror setup like this.  The mirror looks a little dirty, The environment/table cloth/bed comforter or something could have been different.  I don''t know what.  Maybe outside some where with a clean mirror. Something.', '2005-08-08 23:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596509, 212524, 34659, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what I''m looking at here, although the patterns and colors are appealing.</td>', 'I have no idea what I''m looking at here, although the patterns and colors are appealing.', '2005-08-08 23:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
