(1596891, 215210, 3669, '<td valign="top">Done well.  How nice of the horses to pose so well for you by standing so close together is positioning so much alike.  If I didn''t know better, I would have thought these two where conjoined twins.  Beautiful horses.  I think it could use just a little bump up of contrast.</td>', 'Done well.  How nice of the horses to pose so well for you by standing so close together is positioning so much alike.  If I didn''t know better, I would have thought these two where conjoined twins.  Beautiful horses.  I think it could use just a little bump up of contrast.', '2005-08-09 01:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
