(1596900, 215116, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice execution of an illusion.  i like the water droplets.  I''m just not all that crazy about the coloring in this photo.  The skin color on the hand appears too red and clashes with the bluish background.  Perhaps this would be nice in a desaturated or B&amp;W photo.</td>', 'Nice execution of an illusion.  i like the water droplets.  I''m just not all that crazy about the coloring in this photo.  The skin color on the hand appears too red and clashes with the bluish background.  Perhaps this would be nice in a desaturated or B&W photo.', '2005-08-09 01:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596905, 214806, 3669, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture.  I like the colors of the background, but not crazy about the image in the ball.  Very busy.   I think a single object would have been more appropriate and would be more visually appealing..</td>', 'Interesting picture.  I like the colors of the background, but not crazy about the image in the ball.  Very busy.   I think a single object would have been more appropriate and would be more visually appealing..', '2005-08-09 01:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
