(1596979, 212821, 39349, '<td valign="top">Great reproduction of a classic optical illusion. What would I change? I would like to see the black tiles more squared off and even, some are casting shadows that take away from your shot.</td>', 'Great reproduction of a classic optical illusion. What would I change? I would like to see the black tiles more squared off and even, some are casting shadows that take away from your shot.', '2005-08-09 02:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596984, 213690, 39349, '<td valign="top">Okay, how''d you pull this one off....been trying to figure it out for a while now...awesome!</td>', 'Okay, how''d you pull this one off....been trying to figure it out for a while now...awesome!', '2005-08-09 02:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
