(1596990, 213900, 39349, '<td valign="top">Love the textures going on in this picture. The lighter or "hardened part in the upper left is only a tad distracting but a great photo!</td>', 'Love the textures going on in this picture. The lighter or "hardened part in the upper left is only a tad distracting but a great photo!', '2005-08-09 02:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
