(1597021, 215026, 9906, '<td valign="top">Not sure that your choice of b/w treatment works in this instance.  It kind of hides the illusion that  you are trying to show.  I think that a different color shirt might help to accentuate the illusion instead of masking it...<br/>TC</td>', 'Not sure that your choice of b/w treatment works in this instance.  It kind of hides the illusion that  you are trying to show.  I think that a different color shirt might help to accentuate the illusion instead of masking it...TC', '2005-08-09 02:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1597023, 215116, 37893, '<td valign="top">You''re "clear blooded" :) This is a good one :) How did you do this coming from only four fingers? Where''s Tommy Thumb? LOL</td>', 'You''re "clear blooded" :) This is a good one :) How did you do this coming from only four fingers? Where''s Tommy Thumb? LOL', '2005-08-09 02:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
