(1597026, 215186, 9906, '<td valign="top">When you have a studio type set up shot such as this, it''s the little details that make or break the shot.  In this instance you have what appears to be a dirty die at the two o''clock position.  It may not be dirty, it could simply be imperfections in the die itself.  However that is enough to be a tad bit put offish.  Just out of curiousity, why did you choose a b/w treatment for this?<br/>TC</td>', 'When you have a studio type set up shot such as this, it''s the little details that make or break the shot.  In this instance you have what appears to be a dirty die at the two o''clock position.  It may not be dirty, it could simply be imperfections in the die itself.  However that is enough to be a tad bit put offish.  Just out of curiousity, why did you choose a b/w treatment for this?TC', '2005-08-09 02:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1597027, 214616, 37893, '<td valign="top">I think you should rotate the crop counter clockwise slightly. Where is the box? Cool trick :)</td>', 'I think you should rotate the crop counter clockwise slightly. Where is the box? Cool trick :)', '2005-08-09 02:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1597030, 215210, 37893, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Bumping up to 7 on this one :)</td>', 'Very nice. Bumping up to 7 on this one :)', '2005-08-09 02:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1597031, 214823, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice reflective shot. I like the duotone. Quite effective.</td>', 'Nice reflective shot. I like the duotone. Quite effective.', '2005-08-09 02:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1597033, 213489, 37893, '<td valign="top">The antenna in the background is quite distracting. I''m not sure which one is your main focus.</td>', 'The antenna in the background is quite distracting. I''m not sure which one is your main focus.', '2005-08-09 02:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1597034, 213900, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great concept!  I love it.  My only complaint is that the lighting makes the shot kinda flat.  Ya need a little more detale in the shadows.  Was this one light or two?  A little fill light placed to the left of frame may have made this pop more...<br/>TC</td>', 'Great concept!  I love it.  My only complaint is that the lighting makes the shot kinda flat.  Ya need a little more detale in the shadows.  Was this one light or two?  A little fill light placed to the left of frame may have made this pop more...TC', '2005-08-09 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
