(1597112, 214284, 9906, '<td valign="top">Incredible lighting though a touch of reflected fill under her hand would have been a bonus.  Great expression in your model!  The catch light in her eyes looks a little off though with the lighting of the rest of the shot.  Just a little too bright.  My only REAL complaint though is the ball doesn''t look round.  It is a ball right?  I don''t know if you got jpeg jaggies goin'' on or if it''s in the way you suspended the ball.  However overall I find my eye going to the girl and not the ball so it''s not really much of an issue!  Kudos<br/>TC</td>', 'Incredible lighting though a touch of reflected fill under her hand would have been a bonus.  Great expression in your model!  The catch light in her eyes looks a little off though with the lighting of the rest of the shot.  Just a little too bright.  My only REAL complaint though is the ball doesn''t look round.  It is a ball right?  I don''t know if you got jpeg jaggies goin'' on or if it''s in the way you suspended the ball.  However overall I find my eye going to the girl and not the ball so it''s not really much of an issue!  KudosTC', '2005-08-09 03:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
