(1597136, 214808, 9906, '<td valign="top">These are the types of shots that I like to comment on the most.  The ones where I see the most potential!  This shot is very original!  I really hope ya show the set up behind (or should I say above) it!  unfortunately you picked maybe the worst time of day to shoot it.  Your lighting is kinda harsh and coming from the angle that it is it doesn''t pull out the textural details in the flowers as they are arranged.  I''m also put off by most of the feet being in shadow.  Depending on the orientation here, If shot early in the morning or later at night this could be a top ten shot!<br/>TC<br/>Oh and could ya move around a little so that the background was move even?  The dark fence top right kinda draws your eye away from the subject...</td>', 'These are the types of shots that I like to comment on the most.  The ones where I see the most potential!  This shot is very original!  I really hope ya show the set up behind (or should I say above) it!  unfortunately you picked maybe the worst time of day to shoot it.  Your lighting is kinda harsh and coming from the angle that it is it doesn''t pull out the textural details in the flowers as they are arranged.  I''m also put off by most of the feet being in shadow.  Depending on the orientation here, If shot early in the morning or later at night this could be a top ten shot!TCOh and could ya move around a little so that the background was move even?  The dark fence top right kinda draws your eye away from the subject...', '2005-08-09 03:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
