(1597153, 214478, 9906, '<td valign="top">You''re probably not gonna like this comment, however I feel compelled, when commenting, to say it the way I see it.  IMHO you have violated the spirit of the DPC community.  This is not the Digital Graphics Art Challenge site, it''s Digital Photography Challenge sSite.  I believe that this would be a simple snapshot without the major element of the frame that you added.  I also believe that you have not honored the spirit of the challenge which is to PHOTOGRAPH an illusion.  This illusion is totally created in post processing.  In other words, you attempted to take a rather boring shot and create something out of it.  Putting that aside for a moment, your frame within the frame appears to be rather forced and awkward.  It doesn''t lift the shot, it distracts.  Given all of this, I''m afraid that I can not give you a very high score.  In another forum, it may have done well...<br/>TC</td>', 'You''re probably not gonna like this comment, however I feel compelled, when commenting, to say it the way I see it.  IMHO you have violated the spirit of the DPC community.  This is not the Digital Graphics Art Challenge site, it''s Digital Photography Challenge sSite.  I believe that this would be a simple snapshot without the major element of the frame that you added.  I also believe that you have not honored the spirit of the challenge which is to PHOTOGRAPH an illusion.  This illusion is totally created in post processing.  In other words, you attempted to take a rather boring shot and create something out of it.  Putting that aside for a moment, your frame within the frame appears to be rather forced and awkward.  It doesn''t lift the shot, it distracts.  Given all of this, I''m afraid that I can not give you a very high score.  In another forum, it may have done well...TC', '2005-08-09 03:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
