(1598954, 214806, 12583, '<td valign="top">Oooo! I like this. THe colors don''t appeal to me as much, but they''re better there than not (B&amp;W). THe focus seems a bit soft on the ball and wooden "fingers?", but the overall illusion is good, and one I can understand, and I''m a big fan of that!! :)</td>', 'Oooo! I like this. THe colors don''t appeal to me as much, but they''re better there than not (B&W). THe focus seems a bit soft on the ball and wooden "fingers?", but the overall illusion is good, and one I can understand, and I''m a big fan of that!! :)', '2005-08-09 22:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1598956, 214456, 12583, '<td valign="top">It took me quite some time to see the illusion, and when I did, I was impressed. However, the clutter and lack of sharp focus detracts for me. A clear cupboard with just a few key items would have scored much better from me, but hurrah for a clear, unique illusion. :)</td>', 'It took me quite some time to see the illusion, and when I did, I was impressed. However, the clutter and lack of sharp focus detracts for me. A clear cupboard with just a few key items would have scored much better from me, but hurrah for a clear, unique illusion. :)', '2005-08-09 22:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1598957, 213962, 12583, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus and the warmth of this shot. Well done!</td>', 'I like the soft focus and the warmth of this shot. Well done!', '2005-08-09 22:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
