(1598970, 215122, 12583, '<td valign="top">While this is unarguably an illusion, I don''t find it to be a very attractive one (the subject, the floral bottom, the frame of the mirror all detract IMO). This might have been better shot with a nice solid background and with the surface the item was on level and flush with the mirror, so you don''t get that wooden line through there at a crooked angle</td>', 'While this is unarguably an illusion, I don''t find it to be a very attractive one (the subject, the floral bottom, the frame of the mirror all detract IMO). This might have been better shot with a nice solid background and with the surface the item was on level and flush with the mirror, so you don''t get that wooden line through there at a crooked angle', '2005-08-09 22:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1598972, 213567, 12583, '<td valign="top">This is very grainy and unfocused for me, though I like the idea.</td>', 'This is very grainy and unfocused for me, though I like the idea.', '2005-08-09 22:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
