(1601794, 214032, 35274, '<td valign="top">Correct me if I''m wrong but it looks like the card is stuck to your/your model''s thumb. But aside from not being that hard to figure out (unless it really ISN''T stuck to your/your model''s  thumb, and it just looks like it, when you actually used fishing line or something) this is a very well done photo. And by that I mean the composition, tones, quality, sharpness, etc. are all very good, so I hope you do well :-)</td>', 'Correct me if I''m wrong but it looks like the card is stuck to your/your model''s thumb. But aside from not being that hard to figure out (unless it really ISN''T stuck to your/your model''s  thumb, and it just looks like it, when you actually used fishing line or something) this is a very well done photo. And by that I mean the composition, tones, quality, sharpness, etc. are all very good, so I hope you do well :-)', '2005-08-10 17:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
