(1602328, 215123, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice concept. What you have here is very well done. Avenues of exploration may have led one to a simpler setting. While the chair is a beauty, the viewer can not imagine a young boy filled with adventure sitting on it. A napsack, a sleeping bag with a few candles, etc, etc. Now, if time constraints did not allow for a different execution, then I would have changed angles to hide the wires. Even the plant should have been reconsidered to simplify the image. On the positive side the double exposure was very well done. 6</td>', 'This is a very nice concept. What you have here is very well done. Avenues of exploration may have led one to a simpler setting. While the chair is a beauty, the viewer can not imagine a young boy filled with adventure sitting on it. A napsack, a sleeping bag with a few candles, etc, etc. Now, if time constraints did not allow for a different execution, then I would have changed angles to hide the wires. Even the plant should have been reconsidered to simplify the image. On the positive side the double exposure was very well done. 6', '2005-08-10 20:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
