(1602951, 215207, 42048, '<td valign="top">lol, AWESOME!</td>', 'lol, AWESOME!', '2005-08-11 00:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602960, 213689, 13688, '<td valign="top">wow...talk about uncomfortable, creepy feelings from a photo.  the postprocessing really adds to the feeling for me.  nice work.</td>', 'wow...talk about uncomfortable, creepy feelings from a photo.  the postprocessing really adds to the feeling for me.  nice work.', '2005-08-11 01:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602992, 214547, 13688, '<td valign="top">fantastic idea.  i wish the lighting was a little less harsh.  would have been even cooler if you had included the little shrub thing when you took the first photo so it would have had a reflection for the second.  i guess you would have still had to tone down the shadow, but i assume that wouldn''t have been a problem as you managed to clone out the shadow of the yellow flower pretty well.  there does appear to be just a wee bit of strange coloring just above it that looks like it might have been left by some errant cloning.  still a very, very good entry.</td>', 'fantastic idea.  i wish the lighting was a little less harsh.  would have been even cooler if you had included the little shrub thing when you took the first photo so it would have had a reflection for the second.  i guess you would have still had to tone down the shadow, but i assume that wouldn''t have been a problem as you managed to clone out the shadow of the yellow flower pretty well.  there does appear to be just a wee bit of strange coloring just above it that looks like it might have been left by some errant cloning.  still a very, very good entry.', '2005-08-11 01:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603000, 215121, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is a very good illusion but I think it could have been carried out better. Firstly, the background (forest) is too bright, imo, and competes with your subjects. Secondly, it''s very hard to see the "faery," and she appears oddly positioned over the young woman''s wrist.  Focus is off and it looks as though you''ve applied noise reduction a bit too aggresively, as on the large tree on the right, which I also find distracting just from it''s presence.  <br/> <br/>My guess is that you metered off the white dress and increased exposure compensation to get the white dress white, which you nailed, but in the process, you overexposed the rest of the picture.  I think this picture has a lot of potential that can be realized with better post processing. <br/> <br/>I hope you found this helpful and I didn''t mean to sound harsh. If I was, then please accept my apologies.</td>', 'This is a very good illusion but I think it could have been carried out better. Firstly, the background (forest) is too bright, imo, and competes with your subjects. Secondly, it''s very hard to see the "faery," and she appears oddly positioned over the young woman''s wrist.  Focus is off and it looks as though you''ve applied noise reduction a bit too aggresively, as on the large tree on the right, which I also find distracting just from it''s presence.   My guess is that you metered off the white dress and increased exposure compensation to get the white dress white, which you nailed, but in the process, you overexposed the rest of the picture.  I think this picture has a lot of potential that can be realized with better post processing.  I hope you found this helpful and I didn''t mean to sound harsh. If I was, then please accept my apologies.', '2005-08-11 01:20:36.000000', NULL, 1);
