(1605043, 214386, 17507, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to think of how you did this, and I can''t really be sure, thought I''d guess that the glass pebbles are on some kind of flat surface. I don''t really know what the illusion is, but it looks weird and I like it, so I''m giving it a 7 anyway. I think that this image may have benefited from a wider angle lens, to get more perspective on the stones (front larger, back smaller), which would make the appearance of motion stronger.</td>', 'I''m trying to think of how you did this, and I can''t really be sure, thought I''d guess that the glass pebbles are on some kind of flat surface. I don''t really know what the illusion is, but it looks weird and I like it, so I''m giving it a 7 anyway. I think that this image may have benefited from a wider angle lens, to get more perspective on the stones (front larger, back smaller), which would make the appearance of motion stronger.', '2005-08-11 23:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
