(1605169, 214813, 18799, '<td valign="top">I usually despise Woodie... this is an exception -   this one is terrific!  You''ve really thought the physical dynamics out.  Perfect 10</td>', 'I usually despise Woodie... this is an exception -   this one is terrific!  You''ve really thought the physical dynamics out.  Perfect 10', '2005-08-12 00:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605193, 213689, 39483, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo!!! The set up, the pinkish/purple hue to the sky, the way the baby seems to hang weightless in the sky... 10 !!! <br/>The only minor thing I might have changed (IMHO) would have been the bit of background at the bottom. I think that an even lower angle where the adult''s feet are more even with the horizon might have increased the contrast of the entire body...but that''s so minor! Wonderful photo!!! well done...hope you ribbon</td>', 'I really like this photo!!! The set up, the pinkish/purple hue to the sky, the way the baby seems to hang weightless in the sky... 10 !!! The only minor thing I might have changed (IMHO) would have been the bit of background at the bottom. I think that an even lower angle where the adult''s feet are more even with the horizon might have increased the contrast of the entire body...but that''s so minor! Wonderful photo!!! well done...hope you ribbon', '2005-08-12 00:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605206, 214510, 39483, '<td valign="top">What an amazing shot!  The illusion is perfect and so is the composition. What an original idea. I like how the jeans create an added component of contrast... I hope you ribbon!<br/>I do wonder how the image would look with the water still blue??</td>', 'What an amazing shot!  The illusion is perfect and so is the composition. What an original idea. I like how the jeans create an added component of contrast... I hope you ribbon!I do wonder how the image would look with the water still blue??', '2005-08-12 00:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
