(1605240, 214299, 39483, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful photo! The kids must have had a blast helping you out! I''ve seen this sort of example in the "tutorial" section but your photo seems even harder to create since the background is all black and the girl is actually equally lit  compared to the boy...<br/>The expression on their faces is priceless and the set up perfect! great lighting, composition and execution! I hope you finish high up!! <br/>(The only tiny thing I might have changed is his bracelet which distracts a bit from their faces...) <br/>oh and the squarish crop works well here!</td>', 'What a wonderful photo! The kids must have had a blast helping you out! I''ve seen this sort of example in the "tutorial" section but your photo seems even harder to create since the background is all black and the girl is actually equally lit  compared to the boy...The expression on their faces is priceless and the set up perfect! great lighting, composition and execution! I hope you finish high up!! (The only tiny thing I might have changed is his bracelet which distracts a bit from their faces...) oh and the squarish crop works well here!', '2005-08-12 00:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
