(1605290, 215008, 33400, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute..  Very clean and crisp.  Good photo</td>', 'It took me a minute..  Very clean and crisp.  Good photo', '2005-08-12 00:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605300, 215107, 39429, '<td valign="top">The illusion of a contortionist (sp) is off because of the size of feet in proportion to the body - it shows up as a child''s on an adult.  The quality of the image is that of a snapshot vs. a photograph.  The idea is unique and well worth developing further.  2</td>', 'The illusion of a contortionist (sp) is off because of the size of feet in proportion to the body - it shows up as a child''s on an adult.  The quality of the image is that of a snapshot vs. a photograph.  The idea is unique and well worth developing further.  2', '2005-08-12 00:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605303, 213946, 39429, '<td valign="top">You''ve obviously put in alot of effort into this shot.  The makeup, expression and technical qualities of the faces is very strong.  The composition doesn''t work well, however, as the "masks" are too far apart with too much negative space.  This shot would have worked much better if the framed were filled with the masks. 4</td>', 'You''ve obviously put in alot of effort into this shot.  The makeup, expression and technical qualities of the faces is very strong.  The composition doesn''t work well, however, as the "masks" are too far apart with too much negative space.  This shot would have worked much better if the framed were filled with the masks. 4', '2005-08-12 01:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605313, 214365, 39429, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a good amount of detail in this image.  However, it is the same details that cause me problems in the illusion.  The Center is the place of importance pyschologically.  The flawed paint is jarring in the center because it is not really that important.  The shadows do give the illusion of stairs to a certain degree.  My favorite part is the shifting vantage point that causes the shutters to appear to change angles. Overall, a strong graphic image with even more potential. 6</td>', 'You''ve got a good amount of detail in this image.  However, it is the same details that cause me problems in the illusion.  The Center is the place of importance pyschologically.  The flawed paint is jarring in the center because it is not really that important.  The shadows do give the illusion of stairs to a certain degree.  My favorite part is the shifting vantage point that causes the shutters to appear to change angles. Overall, a strong graphic image with even more potential. 6', '2005-08-12 01:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605319, 215207, 22459, '<td valign="top">What a nice little surprise this one is. First class illusion and a great image also</td>', 'What a nice little surprise this one is. First class illusion and a great image also', '2005-08-12 01:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605320, 215034, 39429, '<td valign="top">I am missing the illusion.  Looking at the photo, I find the foreground leaves distracting, the lighting to be fighting against the photo as a whole and the compostion to be bland.  I do, however, find each figure in the image to be interest and enjoyable to look at.  I would have found it much stronger to crop for the individual elements. 3</td>', 'I am missing the illusion.  Looking at the photo, I find the foreground leaves distracting, the lighting to be fighting against the photo as a whole and the compostion to be bland.  I do, however, find each figure in the image to be interest and enjoyable to look at.  I would have found it much stronger to crop for the individual elements. 3', '2005-08-12 01:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605322, 214862, 22459, '<td valign="top">Nice illusion using reflections but the image needed to be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Nice illusion using reflections but the image needed to be a bit sharper.', '2005-08-12 01:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
