(1605332, 214860, 39429, '<td valign="top">I am missing the illusion.  It looks like an empty frame hung over a wallpaper border.  Technically the image has some nice color, especially the center wood, although the color fades on the right.  The lighting does not really enhance the shot, not does the compostion.  There is plenty of detail in the image. 3</td>', 'I am missing the illusion.  It looks like an empty frame hung over a wallpaper border.  Technically the image has some nice color, especially the center wood, although the color fades on the right.  The lighting does not really enhance the shot, not does the compostion.  There is plenty of detail in the image. 3', '2005-08-12 01:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
