(1606660, 213928, 9906, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...  I don''t get it.  I think your trying to make a political statement?  Anyways, this is a little cluttered.  I don''t think you need all the elements that you''ve included to make your statement.  It''s kinda like speaking.  Get your point across with as few words as possible!  Also, your lighting makes this look very flat and your focus appears to be off...<br/>TC</td>', 'Hmmm...  I don''t get it.  I think your trying to make a political statement?  Anyways, this is a little cluttered.  I don''t think you need all the elements that you''ve included to make your statement.  It''s kinda like speaking.  Get your point across with as few words as possible!  Also, your lighting makes this look very flat and your focus appears to be off...TC', '2005-08-12 17:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1606663, 214363, 9906, '<td valign="top">Quite dark and your focus seems to be off.  I don''t know what camera you''re using, but adding a bunch of light would probably help it focus better....<br/>TC</td>', 'Quite dark and your focus seems to be off.  I don''t know what camera you''re using, but adding a bunch of light would probably help it focus better....TC', '2005-08-12 17:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1606669, 215112, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very original take on the challenge!  Wanna see how you got the arm to blend with the hand!  Too bad your laptop image is so flat in color...  I know you wanted it darker, but the hand don''t look quite right.  Your lighting is a little harsh on the background too.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very original take on the challenge!  Wanna see how you got the arm to blend with the hand!  Too bad your laptop image is so flat in color...  I know you wanted it darker, but the hand don''t look quite right.  Your lighting is a little harsh on the background too.TC', '2005-08-12 17:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1606704, 214927, 9906, '<td valign="top">The only thing I would change about this shot is turning it upside down...  Makes a more potent image rotated!<br/>TC</td>', 'The only thing I would change about this shot is turning it upside down...  Makes a more potent image rotated!TC', '2005-08-12 17:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1606708, 215032, 9906, '<td valign="top">This would be a great shot if it wasn''t such a cloudy day.  As it is with such low contrast lighting, the shot is quite flat and it took me a moment to see the boat sailing through the scene.  With better lighting it would most likely have popped right out as it is so much lighter than the rest of the image...<br/>TC</td>', 'This would be a great shot if it wasn''t such a cloudy day.  As it is with such low contrast lighting, the shot is quite flat and it took me a moment to see the boat sailing through the scene.  With better lighting it would most likely have popped right out as it is so much lighter than the rest of the image...TC', '2005-08-12 17:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1606714, 215207, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is actually a very nice image!  I love the overall tonality of it including how the nail color matches the little wheel!  Even the square crop works in this instance when often it looks awkward or forced.  I don''t see an illusion though and for that reason can not give it as high a score as I would like...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is actually a very nice image!  I love the overall tonality of it including how the nail color matches the little wheel!  Even the square crop works in this instance when often it looks awkward or forced.  I don''t see an illusion though and for that reason can not give it as high a score as I would like...TC', '2005-08-12 18:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1606726, 214053, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Ya got the focus spot on on the palm of the hand, but it''s a little soft at the fingertips.  Looks like ya wrapped the tame a little too tight though, ya can see where thing pointer and middle fingers bulge a little above it and also the thumb.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice!  Ya got the focus spot on on the palm of the hand, but it''s a little soft at the fingertips.  Looks like ya wrapped the tame a little too tight though, ya can see where thing pointer and middle fingers bulge a little above it and also the thumb.TC', '2005-08-12 18:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1606727, 214786, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice optical illusion of the natural sort.  Is this a pet or did ya go hunging?<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice optical illusion of the natural sort.  Is this a pet or did ya go hunging?TC', '2005-08-12 18:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
