(1607172, 214032, 41990, '<td valign="top">This image has so many good things going for it.  It is simple, with great composition.  The color is perfect and the the exposure of the subject and lack thereof regarding the background is excellent giving this an old world voodoo vibe.  The intensity of the subject''s gaze is riveting.   Best one yet!  Great work.</td>', 'This image has so many good things going for it.  It is simple, with great composition.  The color is perfect and the the exposure of the subject and lack thereof regarding the background is excellent giving this an old world voodoo vibe.  The intensity of the subject''s gaze is riveting.   Best one yet!  Great work.', '2005-08-13 00:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607174, 214806, 9906, '<td valign="top">You have an interesting take on the challenge and some awesome bokeh!  The scene in the ball though has too much going on and doesn''t hold my attention.  I''m not sure what I''m supposed to be seeing...<br/>TC</td>', 'You have an interesting take on the challenge and some awesome bokeh!  The scene in the ball though has too much going on and doesn''t hold my attention.  I''m not sure what I''m supposed to be seeing...TC', '2005-08-13 00:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607180, 212815, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow, this one I really like!  I wanna see what the set up was.  Love the bluish tonality, but ya got some color banding around the bottome and sides.  Perhaps from resizing...<br/>Good job<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow, this one I really like!  I wanna see what the set up was.  Love the bluish tonality, but ya got some color banding around the bottome and sides.  Perhaps from resizing...Good jobTC', '2005-08-13 00:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607191, 214132, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the illusion part of this, but it is an interesting shot!  Ya do have some color banding in the sky probably from the resizing and a touch of haloing around the dark outlines of the models.  This is probably caused from sharpening.  Do you shoot Jpeg or Raw?<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t get the illusion part of this, but it is an interesting shot!  Ya do have some color banding in the sky probably from the resizing and a touch of haloing around the dark outlines of the models.  This is probably caused from sharpening.  Do you shoot Jpeg or Raw?TC', '2005-08-13 00:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607193, 213130, 9906, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot.  The red tones in the face work wonderfully with the warm tones of the fire.  Not sure about the crop though.  Seems just a touch awkward...<br/>TC</td>', 'I like this one a lot.  The red tones in the face work wonderfully with the warm tones of the fire.  Not sure about the crop though.  Seems just a touch awkward...TC', '2005-08-13 00:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607197, 214597, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very stark image.  It''s a bit contrasty, but seems to work well.  I also like the diaganol lines that draw your eye from corner to corner contrasting with the writing that draws you deeper into the shot.  I''m not sure what the illusion is supposed to be though.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very stark image.  It''s a bit contrasty, but seems to work well.  I also like the diaganol lines that draw your eye from corner to corner contrasting with the writing that draws you deeper into the shot.  I''m not sure what the illusion is supposed to be though.TC', '2005-08-13 00:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607201, 214988, 9906, '<td valign="top">How did you work this shot?  Did you shoot the couch without the model and move her in or the other way around?  Your pillow obviously moved during the exchange...  There are a couple of ways to pull off the lighting of a shot like this and make it look more like I''m assuming you wanted it too look...  What color is the couch itself?  It kinda dissapears into the wall.  Maybe a dark backdrop behind it would bring out more detail and help to eliminate the hot spot upper right wall.<br/>TC.</td>', 'How did you work this shot?  Did you shoot the couch without the model and move her in or the other way around?  Your pillow obviously moved during the exchange...  There are a couple of ways to pull off the lighting of a shot like this and make it look more like I''m assuming you wanted it too look...  What color is the couch itself?  It kinda dissapears into the wall.  Maybe a dark backdrop behind it would bring out more detail and help to eliminate the hot spot upper right wall.TC.', '2005-08-13 00:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607203, 214474, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  It even works having the model so centered in the frame!  Great sky.  Did you use a polarizing filter to get the deep blue?  Where''s the illusion?<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice shot.  It even works having the model so centered in the frame!  Great sky.  Did you use a polarizing filter to get the deep blue?  Where''s the illusion?TC', '2005-08-13 00:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607205, 215008, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is awesome in it''s simplicity!  I love it.  I had to look at it a couple of minutes to figure out how ya did it!  Great lighting.  The only thing I would change and it''s subtle is to maybe use levels to even out the white board a tad...<br/>Kudos<br/>TC</td>', 'This is awesome in it''s simplicity!  I love it.  I had to look at it a couple of minutes to figure out how ya did it!  Great lighting.  The only thing I would change and it''s subtle is to maybe use levels to even out the white board a tad...KudosTC', '2005-08-13 00:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607240, 213312, 9906, '<td valign="top">A very interesting angle.  Don''t know if it qualifies as an illusion though.  Photographically your focus is a touch soft.  Were you zoomed all the way out?  Lenses tend to be soft at both ends of the zoom.  Also since this was a member challenge, I woulda cloned out that darp spot on the  wing by the leading edge towards the body...<br/>TC</td>', 'A very interesting angle.  Don''t know if it qualifies as an illusion though.  Photographically your focus is a touch soft.  Were you zoomed all the way out?  Lenses tend to be soft at both ends of the zoom.  Also since this was a member challenge, I woulda cloned out that darp spot on the  wing by the leading edge towards the body...TC', '2005-08-13 00:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607244, 215123, 9906, '<td valign="top">I like this one!  Nice crisp main image and just enough gost image!.  Too bad your model didn''t have a spooked expression, this would be priceless!  Tell him he did a great job of holding still for it!<br/>TC</td>', 'I like this one!  Nice crisp main image and just enough gost image!.  Too bad your model didn''t have a spooked expression, this would be priceless!  Tell him he did a great job of holding still for it!TC', '2005-08-13 00:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
