(1608575, 212426, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately fits the challenge.  The image seems a bit dark to me though.  The little humpty (while appearing to be good focus) is not very clear.  I wonder if it''s cause he doesn''t seem lit well, or if it''s cause he''s very small in the photo?  The top of the photo is well lit, I like how the egg blends into the background.  The string also adds to the image.  Wonder how it would look if the string were not cutting the image exactly in the center?  Maybe of center the string a bit?  Overall fun image.</td>', 'Definately fits the challenge.  The image seems a bit dark to me though.  The little humpty (while appearing to be good focus) is not very clear.  I wonder if it''s cause he doesn''t seem lit well, or if it''s cause he''s very small in the photo?  The top of the photo is well lit, I like how the egg blends into the background.  The string also adds to the image.  Wonder how it would look if the string were not cutting the image exactly in the center?  Maybe of center the string a bit?  Overall fun image.', '2005-08-13 21:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
