(1608842, 214299, 3080, '<td valign="top">I remember a shot like this from the first illusions challenge.  I like the lighting in this one.  I think you did a good job.  the shadows add to it in my opinion.  Focus and clarity of both the brother and sister are really good and the expressions on both their faces are great.  overall really great shot for the challenge, pleasing to look at and quite funny.  great shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'I remember a shot like this from the first illusions challenge.  I like the lighting in this one.  I think you did a good job.  the shadows add to it in my opinion.  Focus and clarity of both the brother and sister are really good and the expressions on both their faces are great.  overall really great shot for the challenge, pleasing to look at and quite funny.  great shot. ~Heather~', '2005-08-13 23:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608848, 213365, 3080, '<td valign="top">would be hard to add some ''dramatic angle'' on this one, since the illusion is solely based on the angle of the triangle itself, but the centeredness doesn''t really work for me here.  I like the additino of the ball, I think that helps a lot.  background being black makes for nothing distracting.  focus on the triangle seems soft, but I wonder if it''s just the texture that makes it look so?</td>', 'would be hard to add some ''dramatic angle'' on this one, since the illusion is solely based on the angle of the triangle itself, but the centeredness doesn''t really work for me here.  I like the additino of the ball, I think that helps a lot.  background being black makes for nothing distracting.  focus on the triangle seems soft, but I wonder if it''s just the texture that makes it look so?', '2005-08-13 23:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608858, 215195, 3080, '<td valign="top">the photo doesn''t give me the sense of an illusion.  there may BE an illusion, but without the title, it''s just a photo of a boy and his dad fishing.  I''m guessing that the ''illusion'' is that there''s really no fishing line?  lighing is a bit dark on the front side of the people.  focus seems ok, but we really can''t see much detail in anything.  dad''s face is dark, the boy is quite small within the photo, the fishing pole doesn''t really have any detail .  definately a cute photo for a family album.  ~Heather~</td>', 'the photo doesn''t give me the sense of an illusion.  there may BE an illusion, but without the title, it''s just a photo of a boy and his dad fishing.  I''m guessing that the ''illusion'' is that there''s really no fishing line?  lighing is a bit dark on the front side of the people.  focus seems ok, but we really can''t see much detail in anything.  dad''s face is dark, the boy is quite small within the photo, the fishing pole doesn''t really have any detail .  definately a cute photo for a family album.  ~Heather~', '2005-08-13 23:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608874, 215210, 17837, '<td valign="top">a very nice shot, though I believe it lacks contrast. Perhaps a different time of day to get more dramatic lighting would make me score this higher. You covered the topic very well however.</td>', 'a very nice shot, though I believe it lacks contrast. Perhaps a different time of day to get more dramatic lighting would make me score this higher. You covered the topic very well however.', '2005-08-13 23:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608876, 215165, 17837, '<td valign="top">my guess is that this is an advertisement of some sort on a wall, or a mural. Very good illusion though. The lighting could be better, but I wont gripe because you followed the topic very well. Good luck.</td>', 'my guess is that this is an advertisement of some sort on a wall, or a mural. Very good illusion though. The lighting could be better, but I wont gripe because you followed the topic very well. Good luck.', '2005-08-13 23:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608879, 214284, 17837, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the child a little more in focus, not sure if thats soft focus or you were just focusing on the ball. Also, im not exactly sure, but her arm looks a little off. A little to straight? it looks photoshopped.</td>', 'I''d like to see the child a little more in focus, not sure if thats soft focus or you were just focusing on the ball. Also, im not exactly sure, but her arm looks a little off. A little to straight? it looks photoshopped.', '2005-08-13 23:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608885, 212329, 17837, '<td valign="top">a very interesting take on this. I especially like the green water. good job.</td>', 'a very interesting take on this. I especially like the green water. good job.', '2005-08-13 23:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608888, 215112, 17837, '<td valign="top">the background detracts from the image. Overall, im just not too impressed with this shot. IT could use better lighting, and it just doesnt have a wow factor for me.</td>', 'the background detracts from the image. Overall, im just not too impressed with this shot. IT could use better lighting, and it just doesnt have a wow factor for me.', '2005-08-13 23:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
