(1608905, 213130, 17837, '<td valign="top">unfortunetly, the entire image is out of focus. Next time, try to atleast bring one point of interest into focus, so that the subject stands out.</td>', 'unfortunetly, the entire image is out of focus. Next time, try to atleast bring one point of interest into focus, so that the subject stands out.', '2005-08-13 23:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
