(1608916, 215078, 17837, '<td valign="top">a pretty neat take on the challenge. the lighting is a bit harsh on the right wall, and the shadow is a bit distracting. a different lighting setup, and different position, would help to improve this shot. Definitely a hair light, a background light to take out the shadow, and perhaps a light from the camera left.</td>', 'a pretty neat take on the challenge. the lighting is a bit harsh on the right wall, and the shadow is a bit distracting. a different lighting setup, and different position, would help to improve this shot. Definitely a hair light, a background light to take out the shadow, and perhaps a light from the camera left.', '2005-08-13 23:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
