(1609277, 214032, 4628, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I don''t normally like sepia toned images, but this one really impressed me. The facial expression and pose are perfect, as is the focus on the card.</td>', 'Very well done. I don''t normally like sepia toned images, but this one really impressed me. The facial expression and pose are perfect, as is the focus on the card.', '2005-08-14 05:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1609278, 215165, 39483, '<td valign="top">I just entered the comment but it didn''t register on my voting page so here I go again :)<br/> <br/>I really like the illusion and the execution of this shot! very original. <br/>I like the desaturated foreground since it helps focus the eyes on the background figure. IMHO, (if it was a set up photo) I might have made the figure seemingly ''push up'' against the leg to really make it seem like he''s caught! The picture is also just a tad noisy? But these are both minor issues... Well done! 9</td>', 'I just entered the comment but it didn''t register on my voting page so here I go again :) I really like the illusion and the execution of this shot! very original. I like the desaturated foreground since it helps focus the eyes on the background figure. IMHO, (if it was a set up photo) I might have made the figure seemingly ''push up'' against the leg to really make it seem like he''s caught! The picture is also just a tad noisy? But these are both minor issues... Well done! 9', '2005-08-14 06:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1609281, 213657, 39483, '<td valign="top">Great concept! The illusion works well here and the composition is good! I might have made the background more ''lofty'' (sky and clouds...)  though? But good set up and extra points for originality!</td>', 'Great concept! The illusion works well here and the composition is good! I might have made the background more ''lofty'' (sky and clouds...)  though? But good set up and extra points for originality!', '2005-08-14 06:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1609282, 211944, 19959, '<td valign="top">That is kind of cool. You were very lucky to capture this. It is certainly not a stretch to see the face. I would love to see this top 3. Well done!</td>', 'That is kind of cool. You were very lucky to capture this. It is certainly not a stretch to see the face. I would love to see this top 3. Well done!', '2005-08-14 06:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1609283, 214988, 39483, '<td valign="top">well executed shot and composition. <br/>I really like the neutral couch and the bright left hand corner which gives the ''room'' depth... I wonder how it would look if the figure wore a solid colored dress? The dress seems to be of a similar pattern as the pillow and might take a way just a tad from the contrast? but perhaps that was intended... In any case, well done and great lighting!</td>', 'well executed shot and composition. I really like the neutral couch and the bright left hand corner which gives the ''room'' depth... I wonder how it would look if the figure wore a solid colored dress? The dress seems to be of a similar pattern as the pillow and might take a way just a tad from the contrast? but perhaps that was intended... In any case, well done and great lighting!', '2005-08-14 06:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1609284, 215112, 19959, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for these. I saw one with a cat in it once that was nicely done. This is excellent.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for these. I saw one with a cat in it once that was nicely done. This is excellent.', '2005-08-14 06:13:18.000000', NULL, 1);
