(1609657, 215072, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot!  Your illusion don''t quite work though with the green ''sky''.  Your skin tones look a tad bit off.  It also looks like you used the flash.  If you used the flash to get a twinkle in her eye, maybe try putting toilet paper or something else thin over the flash to cut it down a touch.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very cute shot!  Your illusion don''t quite work though with the green ''sky''.  Your skin tones look a tad bit off.  It also looks like you used the flash.  If you used the flash to get a twinkle in her eye, maybe try putting toilet paper or something else thin over the flash to cut it down a touch.TC', '2005-08-14 13:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
