(1609662, 215208, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very cute model!  Interesting choice of post procecssing.  You used a mask and gaussian blur to blur out hte background I''m assuming.  It gives the shot a sort of dreamy look.  Personally I don''t care for it myself.  It looks like your sellection was a tad bit off around her right arm and just above the left arm.  You lost the sharpness in the seperation between the sharp and the blur.  Did you use the flash here?  You have a bit of harsh shadow behind her head.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very cute model!  Interesting choice of post procecssing.  You used a mask and gaussian blur to blur out hte background I''m assuming.  It gives the shot a sort of dreamy look.  Personally I don''t care for it myself.  It looks like your sellection was a tad bit off around her right arm and just above the left arm.  You lost the sharpness in the seperation between the sharp and the blur.  Did you use the flash here?  You have a bit of harsh shadow behind her head.TC', '2005-08-14 13:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
