(1609673, 215196, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow, you did an awsome job of capturing the splash here.  I''d like to see an original size crop of just the splash to see how much detail ya actually got.  It looks like in resizing you may have lost a little.  Overall, this is cropped to tight for my taste and as far as the challenge goes, it''s a little to straight forward for this viewer to count as an illusion.  Great stop action though!<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow, you did an awsome job of capturing the splash here.  I''d like to see an original size crop of just the splash to see how much detail ya actually got.  It looks like in resizing you may have lost a little.  Overall, this is cropped to tight for my taste and as far as the challenge goes, it''s a little to straight forward for this viewer to count as an illusion.  Great stop action though!TC', '2005-08-14 13:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1609675, 213501, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome scene, awesome DOF.  Your a little slanted on your horizon though.  This is an easy fix in Photoshop.  If you need help straightening a shot, PM me after the challenge and I''ll tell ya how.  Your colors seem a little flat too.  Maybe a little tweaking of the levels would hellp bring out the tones in the rocks.  As far as the challenge goes though, this doesn''t really look like an illusion to me...<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome scene, awesome DOF.  Your a little slanted on your horizon though.  This is an easy fix in Photoshop.  If you need help straightening a shot, PM me after the challenge and I''ll tell ya how.  Your colors seem a little flat too.  Maybe a little tweaking of the levels would hellp bring out the tones in the rocks.  As far as the challenge goes though, this doesn''t really look like an illusion to me...TC', '2005-08-14 13:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
