(1610314, 214510, 9906, '<td valign="top">Hey I like this one.  I''m not sure though why you took the color away.  IMHO this shot just screams to be blue...<br/>TC</td>', 'Hey I like this one.  I''m not sure though why you took the color away.  IMHO this shot just screams to be blue...TC', '2005-08-14 21:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610319, 215033, 9906, '<td valign="top">One of the things I keep trying to do is figure out how the illusions were done...  I think that this one is under water?  Like a fish bowl?  Good illusion!  Your colors are nice and crisp and you are nice and sharp.  Your background doesn''t really look like sky though which is why I guess fishbowl with a sky background.<br/>TC</td>', 'One of the things I keep trying to do is figure out how the illusions were done...  I think that this one is under water?  Like a fish bowl?  Good illusion!  Your colors are nice and crisp and you are nice and sharp.  Your background doesn''t really look like sky though which is why I guess fishbowl with a sky background.TC', '2005-08-14 21:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610320, 214860, 9906, '<td valign="top">I guess I don''t get what the illusion is supposed to be.  This shot looks like it is supposed to be centered, but isn''t.  It''s also very flat.  Some side lighting would at least have brought some depth to the frame.  I''m afraid it just ain''t very interesting...<br/>TC</td>', 'I guess I don''t get what the illusion is supposed to be.  This shot looks like it is supposed to be centered, but isn''t.  It''s also very flat.  Some side lighting would at least have brought some depth to the frame.  I''m afraid it just ain''t very interesting...TC', '2005-08-14 21:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610324, 213869, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t see what the illusion is supposed to be.  I''m afraid this isn''t very interesting.  I mean ya look at it for a second and you''re ready to move on.  Is it a real animal or a stuffed one?  Try different angles maybe to find one that works?<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t see what the illusion is supposed to be.  I''m afraid this isn''t very interesting.  I mean ya look at it for a second and you''re ready to move on.  Is it a real animal or a stuffed one?  Try different angles maybe to find one that works?TC', '2005-08-14 21:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610327, 215132, 9906, '<td valign="top">Now this is quite cool!  I love the composition!  You''re centered but it doesn''t look centered.  It''s a little flat though.  I think it''s the lighting.  What time of day was it shot?  From the shadows it looks like it was just before or after mid day.  Much later (or earlier depending on how this is oriented according to the sun) would give it more depth and warmer tones.  Great find though!<br/>TC</td>', 'Now this is quite cool!  I love the composition!  You''re centered but it doesn''t look centered.  It''s a little flat though.  I think it''s the lighting.  What time of day was it shot?  From the shadows it looks like it was just before or after mid day.  Much later (or earlier depending on how this is oriented according to the sun) would give it more depth and warmer tones.  Great find though!TC', '2005-08-14 21:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610334, 214255, 9906, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting shot.  I''m assuming you clued a picture to the mirror.  My only question is why b/w and not color?  I think in color this would be much better.  B/W needs depth and tonality to make it work.  With the shallow DOF you have here you need the color to make it more interesting.  You also had total controll of the background.  A different location for the car to begin with would also help.<br/>TC</td>', 'It''s an interesting shot.  I''m assuming you clued a picture to the mirror.  My only question is why b/w and not color?  I think in color this would be much better.  B/W needs depth and tonality to make it work.  With the shallow DOF you have here you need the color to make it more interesting.  You also had total controll of the background.  A different location for the car to begin with would also help.TC', '2005-08-14 22:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610342, 214059, 9906, '<td valign="top">To me, I look at this shot and see more of a story than an illusion.  The more I look at it, the more I wanna know the back story.<br/>TC</td>', 'To me, I look at this shot and see more of a story than an illusion.  The more I look at it, the more I wanna know the back story.TC', '2005-08-14 22:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610347, 214007, 9906, '<td valign="top">GREAT ILLUSION!  I like this one and thought about doing something like it!  The addition of the cords pins and knots makes the shot!  Without it, it wouldn''t be the same.  The only thing I would change is the lighting.  I know that you had to light it to make the arms dissappear, but this looks a touch flat.  Is that a pick on the right hand thumb or a band aid?  I''m assuming it''s a pick as you put a lot of work into the detals.<br/>Kudos<br/>TC</td>', 'GREAT ILLUSION!  I like this one and thought about doing something like it!  The addition of the cords pins and knots makes the shot!  Without it, it wouldn''t be the same.  The only thing I would change is the lighting.  I know that you had to light it to make the arms dissappear, but this looks a touch flat.  Is that a pick on the right hand thumb or a band aid?  I''m assuming it''s a pick as you put a lot of work into the detals.KudosTC', '2005-08-14 22:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610350, 214365, 9906, '<td valign="top">Venetian blinds.  A nice study piece, but beyond that it doesn''t hold a lot of my attention.  It''s a good piece for b/w.<br/>TC</td>', 'Venetian blinds.  A nice study piece, but beyond that it doesn''t hold a lot of my attention.  It''s a good piece for b/w.TC', '2005-08-14 22:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610356, 214862, 9906, '<td valign="top">At the surface of the mirror?  I see some potential for this shot, but your focus seems to be off.  My eye wanders around the shot looking for the focal point and can not find it.  It''s also a little distracting to have pieces cropped of at the edges.  The lighting is also unimaginative making everything flat.  Moving the lights around may have helped bring out the depth in this.<br/>TC</td>', 'At the surface of the mirror?  I see some potential for this shot, but your focus seems to be off.  My eye wanders around the shot looking for the focal point and can not find it.  It''s also a little distracting to have pieces cropped of at the edges.  The lighting is also unimaginative making everything flat.  Moving the lights around may have helped bring out the depth in this.TC', '2005-08-14 22:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610357, 214923, 37334, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the fit to illusion but I love the image</td>', 'I''m not sure about the fit to illusion but I love the image', '2005-08-14 22:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610359, 215047, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is very over saturated.  It almosts hurts my eye!  I can''t find a focal point, either from the lens'' focus point of view or from the point of view that there is no place for your eye to land after it wanders around for a second...<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow, this is very over saturated.  It almosts hurts my eye!  I can''t find a focal point, either from the lens'' focus point of view or from the point of view that there is no place for your eye to land after it wanders around for a second...TC', '2005-08-14 22:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610360, 214616, 17837, '<td valign="top">an interesting idea here. Im not sure its on topic, so I can only give it a 5. Good effort though! and a great idea!</td>', 'an interesting idea here. Im not sure its on topic, so I can only give it a 5. Good effort though! and a great idea!', '2005-08-14 22:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610366, 214813, 9906, '<td valign="top">LOL....  That''s what my ol'' lady says first thing in the morning!  :-P  This is one of the best ''woodie'' shot''s I''ve seen in a while.  It looks a little dull though like it could use a boost in lighting (which may spoil the illusion...  You hung the woodie up with string?) or levels.<br/>TC</td>', 'LOL....  That''s what my ol'' lady says first thing in the morning!  :-P  This is one of the best ''woodie'' shot''s I''ve seen in a while.  It looks a little dull though like it could use a boost in lighting (which may spoil the illusion...  You hung the woodie up with string?) or levels.TC', '2005-08-14 22:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610371, 215074, 17837, '<td valign="top">im not sure I get it.</td>', 'im not sure I get it.', '2005-08-14 22:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610372, 214761, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t get what the illusion is supposed to be...  Your background looks very muddied.  I think you could fix that by selecting it and boosting the highlight levels, in effect blowing it out.  It''s also a little noisy in the background.  Neat image would help that out.  Overall, I don''t find a lot of wow factor in this shot...<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t get what the illusion is supposed to be...  Your background looks very muddied.  I think you could fix that by selecting it and boosting the highlight levels, in effect blowing it out.  It''s also a little noisy in the background.  Neat image would help that out.  Overall, I don''t find a lot of wow factor in this shot...TC', '2005-08-14 22:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610383, 214299, 9906, '<td valign="top">If this is a perspective shot, it''s one of the best I''ve seen in a while.  If the little girl is a cut out which I''m leaning towards thinking, then you got the lighting wrong on the little girl.  Her hightlights and shadows don''t match the highlights and shadows of the boy!  Nice illusion though and it''s nice to see decent lighting in a set up shot for a change.<br/>TC</td>', 'If this is a perspective shot, it''s one of the best I''ve seen in a while.  If the little girl is a cut out which I''m leaning towards thinking, then you got the lighting wrong on the little girl.  Her hightlights and shadows don''t match the highlights and shadows of the boy!  Nice illusion though and it''s nice to see decent lighting in a set up shot for a change.TC', '2005-08-14 22:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610384, 214632, 17837, '<td valign="top">This picture made me laugh so hard. It hits the topic at hand VERY MUCH. the lighting around the face could be burned in a bit, as its a bit over exposed. 8</td>', 'This picture made me laugh so hard. It hits the topic at hand VERY MUCH. the lighting around the face could be burned in a bit, as its a bit over exposed. 8', '2005-08-14 22:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610386, 214372, 9906, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  It took me a moment to see what I was looking at though.  Great lighting to help bring out definition in the mask itself.  The only thing I find distracting is the relatively bright reflection inside the mask.<br/>TC</td>', 'I like this a lot.  It took me a moment to see what I was looking at though.  Great lighting to help bring out definition in the mask itself.  The only thing I find distracting is the relatively bright reflection inside the mask.TC', '2005-08-14 22:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
