(1610391, 213489, 9906, '<td valign="top">Well it''s definately a different take on the challenge theme.  I know what you where going for, but to me it doesn''t really work.  For one thing, your sky sucks.  If you had a nice poofy cloud sky it would be better.  If you shot at a different time of day to bring out the depth of the shot it would be better.  This just isn''t very interesting to me as shot though...<br/>TC</td>', 'Well it''s definately a different take on the challenge theme.  I know what you where going for, but to me it doesn''t really work.  For one thing, your sky sucks.  If you had a nice poofy cloud sky it would be better.  If you shot at a different time of day to bring out the depth of the shot it would be better.  This just isn''t very interesting to me as shot though...TC', '2005-08-14 22:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
