(1610405, 214725, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t like commenting on titles, but am always put off when I''m instructed what to do by the title.  In an illusion challenge I''m going to look hard at the shots and don''t need to be told to...<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t like commenting on titles, but am always put off when I''m instructed what to do by the title.  In an illusion challenge I''m going to look hard at the shots and don''t need to be told to...TC', '2005-08-14 22:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
