(1610443, 214210, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too abstact for my taste...  What is the illusion supposed to be?<br/>TC</td>', 'Too abstact for my taste...  What is the illusion supposed to be?TC', '2005-08-14 22:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610463, 212418, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is really kinda dark.  In order to make B/W really work you need a wide tonal range which is lacking in this shot.  It also looks like you used the on camera flash.  This will always produce harsh shadows that are usually unatractive especially when the subject is close to the background as in this case.  Move the subject away from the background and use other lighting (I never use the on camera flash...) and this would work better!<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow, this is really kinda dark.  In order to make B/W really work you need a wide tonal range which is lacking in this shot.  It also looks like you used the on camera flash.  This will always produce harsh shadows that are usually unatractive especially when the subject is close to the background as in this case.  Move the subject away from the background and use other lighting (I never use the on camera flash...) and this would work better!TC', '2005-08-14 23:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610470, 213689, 9906, '<td valign="top">How did he through the child up in the air when he has no arms?  :-P  Cute shot bot it''s kinda dark and you ahave some haloing and color banding issues.  The haloing is probably form oversharpening.  The color banding may be from how you resized the shot...<br/>TC</td>', 'How did he through the child up in the air when he has no arms?  :-P  Cute shot bot it''s kinda dark and you ahave some haloing and color banding issues.  The haloing is probably form oversharpening.  The color banding may be from how you resized the shot...TC', '2005-08-14 23:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610473, 215116, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow...  Your colors are really off in this shot.  I'' don''t know how to fix this one.  Maybe playing around with levels.  You used the on camera flash to didin''t ya.  I think this could be much improved if you didn''t use the flash and instead brought in other light sources.  Move them around and experiment till you have good results...<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow...  Your colors are really off in this shot.  I'' don''t know how to fix this one.  Maybe playing around with levels.  You used the on camera flash to didin''t ya.  I think this could be much improved if you didn''t use the flash and instead brought in other light sources.  Move them around and experiment till you have good results...TC', '2005-08-14 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610478, 214450, 9906, '<td valign="top">Best perspective shot of the lot!  Great tonality.  Great choice of using a sepia type processing.  The only thing I wann know is if the haloing is from oversharpening or if it''s from the harsh backlighing.  It''s the only thing that I think detracts from this shot.  Great silhouette.  Great use of the square crop.  Nicely done!<br/>TC</td>', 'Best perspective shot of the lot!  Great tonality.  Great choice of using a sepia type processing.  The only thing I wann know is if the haloing is from oversharpening or if it''s from the harsh backlighing.  It''s the only thing that I think detracts from this shot.  Great silhouette.  Great use of the square crop.  Nicely done!TC', '2005-08-14 23:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610484, 214954, 9906, '<td valign="top">Love the concept!  Your lighting is very harsh.  It makes the shot look very flat and gives ugly shadows.  It also tends to dull the colors.  Nice illusion though!<br/>TC</td>', 'Love the concept!  Your lighting is very harsh.  It makes the shot look very flat and gives ugly shadows.  It also tends to dull the colors.  Nice illusion though!TC', '2005-08-14 23:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610486, 212344, 9906, '<td valign="top">I"d like to know how this was done.  Long exposure or lots of balls...  Did I just say you got lot''s of balls?  :-O<br/>TC</td>', 'I"d like to know how this was done.  Long exposure or lots of balls...  Did I just say you got lot''s of balls?  :-OTC', '2005-08-14 23:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610496, 214955, 9906, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot overall, but I can''t call it an illusion.  Too bad you didn''t have a nice dramatic sky...<br/>TC</td>', 'I really like this shot overall, but I can''t call it an illusion.  Too bad you didn''t have a nice dramatic sky...TC', '2005-08-14 23:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610500, 215195, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t know where the illusion is.  I can only see a snapshot that has no emotional connection to the viewer unless they know the subjects.<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t know where the illusion is.  I can only see a snapshot that has no emotional connection to the viewer unless they know the subjects.TC', '2005-08-14 23:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610505, 215198, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  The lighting leaves a little to be desired though.  The skin tones of the hand don''t quite look right and the cut out kid doesn''t match the rest of the shot.  Shoot this indoors where you have more controll over the light and you could really make this pop!<br/>TC</td>', 'Great concept.  The lighting leaves a little to be desired though.  The skin tones of the hand don''t quite look right and the cut out kid doesn''t match the rest of the shot.  Shoot this indoors where you have more controll over the light and you could really make this pop!TC', '2005-08-14 23:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610509, 214389, 9906, '<td valign="top">The focus is off.  The lighting is very harsh which give the shot no depth.  It also has no illusion in it.  It''s a straight forward shot of a bird...<br/>TC</td>', 'The focus is off.  The lighting is very harsh which give the shot no depth.  It also has no illusion in it.  It''s a straight forward shot of a bird...TC', '2005-08-14 23:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610513, 214923, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome blue tones.  Great detail in the reflections due to the backlighing caused by the blue lights.  However, I don''t see how it fits the challenge...<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome blue tones.  Great detail in the reflections due to the backlighing caused by the blue lights.  However, I don''t see how it fits the challenge...TC', '2005-08-14 23:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610517, 214251, 9906, '<td valign="top">It looks like you took this shot through a dirty window.  I can not find anything really appealing about it besides the way the three branches cut the frame into quarters...<br/>TC</td>', 'It looks like you took this shot through a dirty window.  I can not find anything really appealing about it besides the way the three branches cut the frame into quarters...TC', '2005-08-14 23:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610519, 215035, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is just a little too absract for my taste...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is just a little too absract for my taste...TC', '2005-08-14 23:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610522, 213365, 9906, '<td valign="top">A classic illusion that I''ve never seen done in a photograph!  Well lit to accentuate the illusion.  Not sure the ball adds anything, but it doesn''t take away either.<br/>TC</td>', 'A classic illusion that I''ve never seen done in a photograph!  Well lit to accentuate the illusion.  Not sure the ball adds anything, but it doesn''t take away either.TC', '2005-08-14 23:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610527, 212329, 9906, '<td valign="top">The skin tones of the hands are a little put offish to me.  Is it a real hand or fake?  If it''s real, you got some color issues.  If it''s fake it explains things a little.  Still well done even if it needs work.  Try reshooting it under different lighting and you''ll get one that makes everyone go ''Wow!''<br/>TC</td>', 'The skin tones of the hands are a little put offish to me.  Is it a real hand or fake?  If it''s real, you got some color issues.  If it''s fake it explains things a little.  Still well done even if it needs work.  Try reshooting it under different lighting and you''ll get one that makes everyone go ''Wow!''TC', '2005-08-14 23:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610533, 212694, 9906, '<td valign="top">It''s the physics of static electricity.  It''s not an illusion.  From a photographic stand point, as is it''s a snapshot which means that there''s no way for the viewer to become attached unless they know the model.  If the background wasn''t cluttered up with school room stuff it might trancend past status of snapshot.<br/>TC</td>', 'It''s the physics of static electricity.  It''s not an illusion.  From a photographic stand point, as is it''s a snapshot which means that there''s no way for the viewer to become attached unless they know the model.  If the background wasn''t cluttered up with school room stuff it might trancend past status of snapshot.TC', '2005-08-14 23:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610538, 214495, 24528, '<td valign="top">Good job.Very pleasant to the eyes.Good luck</td>', 'Good job.Very pleasant to the eyes.Good luck', '2005-08-14 23:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610542, 214495, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you the benefit of a doubt that it really isn''t a water color.  If it isn''t I don''t know how ya did it.  Is it a reflection that ya turned upside down?  As a photograph though it doesn''t do much for me.  I''m to traditional/conservative to appreciate some shots that are on the absract side or processed to the point that they no longer resemble a photograph...<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m giving you the benefit of a doubt that it really isn''t a water color.  If it isn''t I don''t know how ya did it.  Is it a reflection that ya turned upside down?  As a photograph though it doesn''t do much for me.  I''m to traditional/conservative to appreciate some shots that are on the absract side or processed to the point that they no longer resemble a photograph...TC', '2005-08-14 23:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610575, 215132, 24528, '<td valign="top">Wow this is playing with my mind..Good luck</td>', 'Wow this is playing with my mind..Good luck', '2005-08-14 23:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
