(1610720, 213720, 9906, '<td valign="top">The hard part about trying to make a perspective shot like this work it making sure that the lighting of both subjects match up and add to the illusion.  Unfortunately the lighting here doesn''t match.  It makes it obvious how the ''illusion'' was done...<br/>TC</td>', 'The hard part about trying to make a perspective shot like this work it making sure that the lighting of both subjects match up and add to the illusion.  Unfortunately the lighting here doesn''t match.  It makes it obvious how the ''illusion'' was done...TC', '2005-08-15 00:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610724, 215074, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is the hardest kind of shot for me to comment on.  There is so much here that doesn''t work.  You have too much harsh light.  You have an un attractive dirty subject.  Your focus is a tad bit off.  Your color scheme doesn''t makes sense.  Please don''t take this comment the wrong way.  I truly wanna help, but just don''t know where to start with this image...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is the hardest kind of shot for me to comment on.  There is so much here that doesn''t work.  You have too much harsh light.  You have an un attractive dirty subject.  Your focus is a tad bit off.  Your color scheme doesn''t makes sense.  Please don''t take this comment the wrong way.  I truly wanna help, but just don''t know where to start with this image...TC', '2005-08-15 00:45:54.000000', NULL, 1);
