(1610727, 213577, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great tonality, but it doesn''t hold a lot of interest with me.  It needs something more for a subject.<br/>TC</td>', 'Great tonality, but it doesn''t hold a lot of interest with me.  It needs something more for a subject.TC', '2005-08-15 00:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610731, 215036, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the deja vu reference.  How did you do this shot?  I''m curious.  Overall, the red and green don''t go together real well in this instance...<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t get the deja vu reference.  How did you do this shot?  I''m curious.  Overall, the red and green don''t go together real well in this instance...TC', '2005-08-15 00:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610733, 214725, 34396, '<td valign="top">A very interesting shot.  It is so hard to tell what is up and what is down.  Great capture and compositon!  10</td>', 'A very interesting shot.  It is so hard to tell what is up and what is down.  Great capture and compositon!  10', '2005-08-15 00:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610747, 215122, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot has so much potential.  All it needs is a tweak or two in the lighting and levels.  Your colors are a little flat (levels) and the overall effect is flat (no depth front to back) which is a lighting issue...<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot has so much potential.  All it needs is a tweak or two in the lighting and levels.  Your colors are a little flat (levels) and the overall effect is flat (no depth front to back) which is a lighting issue...TC', '2005-08-15 00:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610750, 214386, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot is a little too abstract for my tast.  The colors don''t quite look right in the glass.  However, I would still like to know how ya did it!<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot is a little too abstract for my tast.  The colors don''t quite look right in the glass.  However, I would still like to know how ya did it!TC', '2005-08-15 00:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
