(1610759, 214547, 9906, '<td valign="top">I see a huge amount of potential in this shot and in your photographic talent here.  This took a lot of work to put together I can tell.  You just need to tweek the lighting.  Experiment try one or two lights on either side and move them around.  Make sure the lighting and tonality of the ''reflection'' match the rest of the shot.  Play with it.  It''ll be worth it!<br/>TC</td>', 'I see a huge amount of potential in this shot and in your photographic talent here.  This took a lot of work to put together I can tell.  You just need to tweek the lighting.  Experiment try one or two lights on either side and move them around.  Make sure the lighting and tonality of the ''reflection'' match the rest of the shot.  Play with it.  It''ll be worth it!TC', '2005-08-15 00:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
