(1610846, 215078, 22379, '<td valign="top">well this *just* made my highest shot ever - JUST but a good start for my first members challenge.<br/> <br/>I am disappointed how many people wanted no shadow - the shadow makes the illusion. Thanks to Kevrobertson, Artan and Scud for spending enough time on the image to realise the reason the shadows were there. <br/> <br/>I love the HP commecial, but no that wasn''t the inspiration, this is a take on an image i shot over a year ago. I have been singing "out of the frame" all week along with the song that matches up with my timecap challenge lol.</td>', 'well this *just* made my highest shot ever - JUST but a good start for my first members challenge. I am disappointed how many people wanted no shadow - the shadow makes the illusion. Thanks to Kevrobertson, Artan and Scud for spending enough time on the image to realise the reason the shadows were there.  I love the HP commecial, but no that wasn''t the inspiration, this is a take on an image i shot over a year ago. I have been singing "out of the frame" all week along with the song that matches up with my timecap challenge lol.', '2005-08-15 01:09:14.000000', NULL, 0),
