(1611142, 214386, 32602, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments, they''re what make the challenge thing!<br/>Some mention my background showing, darn! I thought it was pitch-black while editing. Think I need a new monitor. I have this one set at brightest already.  <br/> <br/>For those who wonder how it was done: glass is on its side, arranged the stones, tried to make them a bit 3D, rotate in PS. It is a very simple idea.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments, they''re what make the challenge thing!Some mention my background showing, darn! I thought it was pitch-black while editing. Think I need a new monitor. I have this one set at brightest already.   For those who wonder how it was done: glass is on its side, arranged the stones, tried to make them a bit 3D, rotate in PS. It is a very simple idea.', '2005-08-15 01:58:59.000000', NULL, 0),
