(1612516, 213365, 11793, '<td valign="top">well done - i thought about trying this illusion but didn''t have any time for this challenge.<br/> <br/>here are a couple i have done - maybe you''d like to try these as well?<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=128456" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">deja vue entry</a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=135448" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">architecture entry</a> <br/> <br/></td>', 'well done - i thought about trying this illusion but didn''t have any time for this challenge. here are a couple i have done - maybe you''d like to try these as well? deja vue entry  architecture entry  ', '2005-08-15 15:26:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1612527, 215074, 26255, '<td valign="top">OK, now I REALLY don''t get it!!!  When I first saw this image, I thought it was someone new to photography and was making a (rather poor) attempt at an optical illusion.  Honestly I felt it was out of focus, the shadow was distracting, the composition rather poor and the subject just plain unappealing.  I looked at your portfolio and the circles image jumped out at me.  I remember it as being my favorite and I picked it to ribbon in the challenge.  The rest of your portfolio is full of beautiful images.  You truly have genuine talent and a keen eye.  What the heck is up with this entry.  Please enlighten me.</td>', 'OK, now I REALLY don''t get it!!!  When I first saw this image, I thought it was someone new to photography and was making a (rather poor) attempt at an optical illusion.  Honestly I felt it was out of focus, the shadow was distracting, the composition rather poor and the subject just plain unappealing.  I looked at your portfolio and the circles image jumped out at me.  I remember it as being my favorite and I picked it to ribbon in the challenge.  The rest of your portfolio is full of beautiful images.  You truly have genuine talent and a keen eye.  What the heck is up with this entry.  Please enlighten me.', '2005-08-15 15:30:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1612586, 214210, 11895, '<td valign="top">I recognized it as the grill of an auto, understood the illusion as it being like an apartment building, scored it high, and am surprised that it did not place in at least the top quarter or better.  It''s a good photo.</td>', 'I recognized it as the grill of an auto, understood the illusion as it being like an apartment building, scored it high, and am surprised that it did not place in at least the top quarter or better.  It''s a good photo.', '2005-08-15 15:50:23.000000', NULL, 0),
