(1613023, 214450, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think your model makes this shot work so well.  It''s my favorite of the challenge.   Her athletic, petite figure and the stance taken here is very androgenous, which I think gives it more of a "power of the gods" sort of mood.   I love the golden tones, the slight haloing of light around the model, and the simplicity of the shot.  Congratulations on a great shot!</td>', 'I think your model makes this shot work so well.  It''s my favorite of the challenge.   Her athletic, petite figure and the stance taken here is very androgenous, which I think gives it more of a "power of the gods" sort of mood.   I love the golden tones, the slight haloing of light around the model, and the simplicity of the shot.  Congratulations on a great shot!', '2005-08-15 18:00:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1613078, 213720, 40456, '<td valign="top">wow, a top twenty finish, I only joined this site a couple of weeks ago so I''m really pleased. Thanks for all of the constructive comments and the praise!! With a busy work life and two kids and a self build my photography is only ever based on grab shots so I''m really pleased with this one. <br/> <br/>Many thanks!!</td>', 'wow, a top twenty finish, I only joined this site a couple of weeks ago so I''m really pleased. Thanks for all of the constructive comments and the praise!! With a busy work life and two kids and a self build my photography is only ever based on grab shots so I''m really pleased with this one.  Many thanks!!', '2005-08-15 18:17:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1613256, 214534, 16488, '<td valign="top">I decided not to vote on this challenge, but I did mean to leave you a comment.....which would have said, "Walter Wick would be proud!"<br/> <br/>I, too, looked to his work for inspiration.  The week didn''t allow me time to pull anything off.  Wouldn''t you love to re-create the one with the pillars?!<br/> <br/>Sweetly done.  Expertly lit.  Props so well chosen.  "Idowse" had an interesting suggestion about confusing the up and the down....always something to build on here, no?</td>', 'I decided not to vote on this challenge, but I did mean to leave you a comment.....which would have said, "Walter Wick would be proud!" I, too, looked to his work for inspiration.  The week didn''t allow me time to pull anything off.  Wouldn''t you love to re-create the one with the pillars?! Sweetly done.  Expertly lit.  Props so well chosen.  "Idowse" had an interesting suggestion about confusing the up and the down....always something to build on here, no?', '2005-08-15 20:04:07.000000', NULL, 0),
