(1613925, 214450, 93, '<td valign="top">I like your outtake a lot better, personally, although this is a rather stunning shot.  The one thing that keeps getting me is what she is standing on. The big black chunk really just doesn''t do this shot justice, but I understand one has to work with what one has.</td>', 'I like your outtake a lot better, personally, although this is a rather stunning shot.  The one thing that keeps getting me is what she is standing on. The big black chunk really just doesn''t do this shot justice, but I understand one has to work with what one has.', '2005-08-16 03:12:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1613932, 215132, 20856, '<td valign="top">You know I really liked the idea of this, but really I realize I like the idea of the original art piece.  I''m not sure how I feel about taking a picture of something and then taking credit for it.  Unless you were involved in the making of the art work...<br/>just my thoughts.</td>', 'You know I really liked the idea of this, but really I realize I like the idea of the original art piece.  I''m not sure how I feel about taking a picture of something and then taking credit for it.  Unless you were involved in the making of the art work...just my thoughts.', '2005-08-16 03:19:40.000000', NULL, 0),
