(1614368, 213489, 11432, '<td valign="top">This is still absolutely hillarious. Gave it an 8 for the funny theme, loved the title.</td>', 'This is still absolutely hillarious. Gave it an 8 for the funny theme, loved the title.', '2005-08-16 10:47:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1614446, 214478, 30049, '<td valign="top">Chris - You know this could make a fun print.  Have you considered taking the desat outer area and lowering the opacity some (I''m assuming you still have it available in layers) - where it is almost ghostlike in appearance?  You would need to add additional border space to allow for framing (especially on the bottom left).<br/> <br/>Just a thought.  BTW, I''ve enjoyed the stir your post about this image has created.  ;^)</td>', 'Chris - You know this could make a fun print.  Have you considered taking the desat outer area and lowering the opacity some (I''m assuming you still have it available in layers) - where it is almost ghostlike in appearance?  You would need to add additional border space to allow for framing (especially on the bottom left). Just a thought.  BTW, I''ve enjoyed the stir your post about this image has created.  ;^)', '2005-08-16 11:50:57.000000', NULL, 0),
