(1616194, 212815, 42265, '<td valign="top">wow...this is a great shot!  I''ve been messing around with flash light exposures, but this is wonderful.  Do I have it right, you put the light on a string and twirled it around the bulb? Great idea!!<br/>I''ll be looking foward to more your shooting!</td>', 'wow...this is a great shot!  I''ve been messing around with flash light exposures, but this is wonderful.  Do I have it right, you put the light on a string and twirled it around the bulb? Great idea!!I''ll be looking foward to more your shooting!', '2005-08-17 00:46:33.000000', NULL, 0),
