(1646584, 214743, 17507, '<td valign="top">you know, what I think would really make this shot work is a mask to block out the overflow blue light. if you made a cutout in the shape of the wine glass and stuck it onto the glass, the only thing that would show is the patterning. that, to my eye, would produce a much more interesting display.</td>', 'you know, what I think would really make this shot work is a mask to block out the overflow blue light. if you made a cutout in the shape of the wine glass and stuck it onto the glass, the only thing that would show is the patterning. that, to my eye, would produce a much more interesting display.', '2005-08-26 00:46:20.000000', NULL, 0),
