(1658277, 212329, 34659, '<td valign="top">LOVE this shot - scored it a 9.  I seem to recall you throwing this image up for additional critique and "PS play".  I also seem to recall that there was a version that increased the detail on the skin and maybe got rid of the "island" beneath the pinky - and thinking that those modifications made it perfect.  Not that it was far off the mark to start with!  I think this was/is not only very creative, but also very emotive.  To me, this shot screams humanity.  Very nice job.</td>', 'LOVE this shot - scored it a 9.  I seem to recall you throwing this image up for additional critique and "PS play".  I also seem to recall that there was a version that increased the detail on the skin and maybe got rid of the "island" beneath the pinky - and thinking that those modifications made it perfect.  Not that it was far off the mark to start with!  I think this was/is not only very creative, but also very emotive.  To me, this shot screams humanity.  Very nice job.', '2005-08-30 15:43:35.000000', NULL, 0),
