(4384290, 215112, 88879, '<td valign="top">Good work! The concept itself is visually successful. If I may add a little criticism you could have paid more attention to the books in the background and had them match up better. Also, you can see the armatures hand behind the actual foreground one. This I felt hurt your technical attention to detail and proficiency being that it''s  the one element that really sells the illusion. I was a digital photo clean up artist for some time so, I notice these things. You have great skills already and apparently great visual concepts. If you apply those other things that I mentioned you''ll be on the right path. Good luck to you in the future!</td>', 'Good work! The concept itself is visually successful. If I may add a little criticism you could have paid more attention to the books in the background and had them match up better. Also, you can see the armatures hand behind the actual foreground one. This I felt hurt your technical attention to detail and proficiency being that it''s  the one element that really sells the illusion. I was a digital photo clean up artist for some time so, I notice these things. You have great skills already and apparently great visual concepts. If you apply those other things that I mentioned you''ll be on the right path. Good luck to you in the future!', '2008-01-11 09:00:55.000000', NULL, 0),
